+    // Analysis is background work by definition. The threads that feed the
+    // audio callback its next chunk (CachingReaderWorker and the engine worker
+    // pool) share the same cores, so an analyzer left at the default weight
+    // competes head-on and the decks glitch audibly while a track is scanned.
